    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lynam Auctioneers are delighted to present a wonderful opportunity to acquire a unique three-bedroom terraced home, ideally positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac in the heart of Dundrum. For anyone seeking an exciting refurbishment project with exceptional potential, please reach out to us today.\r\n\r\nThis charming residence enjoys instant kerb appeal with its attractive red-brick façade and highly convenient location, just minutes’ walk from the Dundrum LUAS.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, buyers will immediately recognise the exceptional potential this property offers. It presents a fantastic opportunity for someone looking to undertake a true “great house revival” and restore the home to its full glory.\r\n\r\nWhile the property undoubtedly requires refurbishment, it offers enormous potential for a purchaser with vision and creativity. The reward will be a wonderful home in a location where literally everything is on your doorstep."
      },
